#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:140
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "FSck1+"
msgstr "accrual, storage, and deduction of miles;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:141
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "yGFGA3"
msgstr "operation of the interactive country map and game bonuses;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:142
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "kro8Xk"
msgstr "placing orders in the web store;"

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:143
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "E0DqTQ"
msgstr "improving the quality of service and customer support."

#: components/Footer/Footer.tsx:145
msgctxt "footer"
msgid "Dl3T8n"
msgstr "We do not transfer your data to third parties, except when necessary for the operation of technological services (SMS sending, simplified admin panel) and only via a secure protocol."

